ed for male fertility (By similarity). Also has an indirect effect on splicing by acting on the splicing factor RBFOX1 (By similarity). Required for spliceosome assembly and stability (By similarity). Required for debranching of intron-derived lariat RNAs (PubMed:41422678)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}